# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated output. Every file in these directories is build product: the
# rendered CVs and letters, their LaTeX, tectonic logs, extracted text, and the
# per-role analysis history. Nothing here is a source of truth — rebuild it with
# scripts/build_cv.py or scripts/build_cover_letter.py.
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored `job-cv/` would also swallow the
# .claude/skills/job-cv/ skill, which is source.
/base-cv/
/job-cv/
/cover-letters/
/build/

# Personal data. Real contact details, employers, and CV history. Each has a
# tracked .example beside it showing the structure: copy it and fill it in.
config/frozen.yaml
config/master_cv.md

# Fetched job postings, cached per role.
config/job-listings/
